{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "c42dfc90c13a8daddf9dc9c8fb7ec410ee7688e1c448279cce843da611c456b4", "ja": "綴られた†物語†", "zh": "文字拼起的†故事†", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "55342418ae8e147f2c0994bceb2bdb082f2b49826d6ff108c0543b386dbe17f3", "ja": "一晩で原稿用紙300枚超えの小説を書き上\nげた百合子。あらすじを聞いたメンバー達は\n興味のきっかけを掴む。しかし昴は分厚い紙\nの束の前で、ひとり浮かない表情をみせるの\nだった……。", "zh": "百合子花了一整晚，写出超过300张稿纸\n的小说。成员们听完故事大纲后，纷纷\n开始感兴趣，唯独昴对这叠厚重的纸张\n露出了闷闷不乐的神情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0292aa545fce647788f13698c5dd8bdf0f4ec2ca4263c886f677608aec520da5", "ja": "（みんなにわかるよう曲の世界観を表現してみせる、と\n百合子は意気込んでいたけど、どうなったかな……）", "zh": "（为了表现出歌曲的世界观，让大家更容易理解，\n百合子卯足了干劲。不过，她要怎么做呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5634c2ebee1dacf50281e587c3a55db252f57d7a2a7c68d3e81b50ba22e286cf", "ja": "おはよう、みんな！\nん？　この机の上にある書類の山は……？", "zh": "你们早啊！\n嗯？桌上这一大叠文件是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "872203dc6aae4e5426fb66b2fdf31a85a0a8f8a29aab355b9928b0b385e0d0d3", "ja": "おっす、{$P$}。\nオレも朝来て、びっくりしたよ～。", "zh": "早，{$P$}。\n我也是一早来就被这个吓到了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "b573a17e29333608a70eb7619c0e47348065064f14c00f80607a1eed7015272a", "ja": "まるで、百科事典のような厚みです。この作品にかける\n七尾さんの熱意が、伝わってきます。……ずっしり。", "zh": "简直就跟百科全书一样厚，能感受出\n七尾对这部作品投注了多少热忱……（沉甸甸）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "c04c5d32d81e92116911bac41c4e8bdbd445c9e7b0dfeb4883ef0a05231df44a", "ja": "原稿用紙……数えてみたら、300枚は超えてた……。", "zh": "杏奈试着数了一下……稿纸……超过300张……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1005_025roc", "source_sha256": "d959cf82330ca2ed739fd856b45fa341496c9d1dd735995137b5b6e0313d58de", "ja": "ロコはアンダースタンドです！　ユリコはクリエイター\nとして、フィータルムーブメントしてるんです！", "zh": "ROCO可以Understand！百合子作为Creator，\n正在Fetal Movement啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "57627ec4abaac5fb77b4666af1bb8b0396a1d56839397dbe9cdf228c6f9c3594", "ja": "おはようございます、{$P$}さん！\nこれで全員そろいましたね？", "zh": "早安，{$P$}先生！\n所有人都到齐了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "99b4e699f44dfa2c5f2718d1040d529599a2dfd4b6d99960932961c4d4dec32a", "ja": "みんなの会話から察するに……\nこの原稿用紙の山が、百合子の言っていた世界観の？", "zh": "根据大家的对话……这一大叠稿纸就是\n百合子之前说的，让大家理解世界观的方式吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "65a77b952d8f73b73342285068e36ea9d966e7885a3bf8dbbe366c47fdf1f423", "ja": "はい！　今回の曲から得たインスピレーションを元に、\n設定を書いてきたんです！", "zh": "是的！我依照这次歌曲带来的灵感，\n写好了设定！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d72c7f3b6ebba7d95c82cc7406cdc15273b614a305dbf679d4167b4e99c75773", "ja": "設定？\nそれにしては、ずいぶん量が多いような……。", "zh": "设定？\n以设定来说，这个量好像颇多的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "6d8b639e0db3ff6869acbf1b5903a63eae531a781835bfc4627f6e4fffc083c5", "ja": "はい！　なんだか筆が乗ったので、そのまま\nストーリーの出だしなんかも書いてみました！", "zh": "是的！因为我动笔之后就停不下来，\n所以顺势连故事开头之类的都写出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "a7a81ab018ff18e16729169e679514b0fefdbbbb1fc74b6ce0ce2698d8672ad5", "ja": "タイトルは仮で、『ドン　ロプスキュリテ』……\nあっ、『闇の中で』っていう意味なんですよ♪", "zh": "作品名就暂订为《dans l'obscurite》……\n啊，这是『在黑暗之中』的意思♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1012_p", "source_sha256": "edef8a9a65846bdfed1908053945e34c03633a30bc682fbf367c9a69676517a4", "ja": "出だしでこれだけの量を？　すごい熱意だ……。\n今回の百合子は、ひと味違うな！", "zh": "光是开头就写了这么多？真是惊人的热忱……\n百合子这次跟平时很不一样呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "0aef4a0b6704ffa280531270dd69b8eaa6cd097a4a612406eec4e60879cf8187", "ja": "空白の原稿用紙を前に、朝日が差し始めた時は\nもう間に合わないかと思ったんですけど……。", "zh": "我坐在空白的稿纸前，发现朝阳已经探出头来时，\n我还以为自己会来不及……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "68a72637f6a28982ada52559310318b9ed2ef7915c9cf9fbe1b064a077fa8084", "ja": "人間って、締切が近づくと、普段では\n考えられない力が出せるものなんですね！", "zh": "原来人一旦面临截稿，\n就能发挥出平时难以想像的力量呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "48c55d23af64ed4df29311ad1ca58faa8369b4f477d7474173fe524988c123ca", "ja": "オレなんて、原稿用紙3枚の作文でも\n1週間くらいかかるのに……信じらんね～！", "zh": "如果是我，光写个只有三张稿纸的作文\n都要花上一个星期耶……太扯了啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "6179d2e3af049a099eb569be5fa78e7f738b77f571bf2f45bacf8061b283daa1", "ja": "しかし、これだけの量です。私たちが読むにも、\n時間がかかりそうです。……1週間で、足りるかな。", "zh": "可是……这么惊人的量，我们要看完\n似乎得花上一些时间……一个星期看得完吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1017_p", "source_sha256": "16d2cde77204bc964e518b6c5d8d5d21551b6db1d4984d9ffdfc55d90c6a2093", "ja": "確かに今すぐ読みきれる量じゃないな……。\n百合子、導入だけざっと説明してくれないか？", "zh": "这个量确实无法马上看完……\n百合子，你可以先跟大家简单说一下故事前言吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "c39bbf8850002d4fe0782dc39770d6e5abfaaed664c01fbae3662f45c23e2e47", "ja": "わかりました！　じゃあ、軽くあらすじだけ！\n主人公は、古い洋館に囚われた5人の少女たちです。", "zh": "好的！那我就简单讲一下故事大纲！\n主角是五名被关在老旧洋房里的少女们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "43e1df27f55cc4754e9e48a217cbf9346185eaddea0988e8e2a06735e4548790", "ja": "彼女たちは理由を知らされないまま、森の奥の屋敷に\n囚われています。お互いの事は、何も知らずに……。", "zh": "她们在不知原因的情况下，被关在森林深处的宅邸中。\n彼此也互不认识……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1020_025roc", "source_sha256": "d8d4f880ff559712912281a239db0f197986c98793caa288c955d642f98b7294", "ja": "ふむふむ……なかなか気になる導入ですね。\n絵になりそうなシチュエーションです！", "zh": "嗯嗯……这起头挺有意思呢。\n感觉这Situation非常有画面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "aae0b625946ce11473c4768c906e6f55b7507e84d2f65e1e9497b06834fb5b96", "ja": "そして明かされる、衝撃の過去……そう！\n彼女たちは前世、血のつながった姉妹だったんです！", "zh": "然后她们将会知晓令人震惊的过往……没错！\n她们五人前世是血脉相连的姊妹！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "1ee652142745a4e5cf50b6a468621573cbeed554fe109970156a3da52c19c31c", "ja": "運命は最初から仕組まれていた……やがて舞台は\n天界へと移り、5人は魔族との争いに巻き込まれ……！", "zh": "她们的命运早在一开始就被设计好了……后来故事的舞台\n转到天界，她们五人被卷入与魔族的纷争……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "9b3dafb9d4f064a7b7fb2127c0712a3ec4261a2b39c8c38e075cc8a9ad099e24", "ja": "なんか、すごい……\n壮大なスケールの話、だね……。", "zh": "感觉真厉害……\n故事的规模相当宏大呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1024_p", "source_sha256": "baf930c8567afd43e2b2f26dd14c2c801b244c8e419f748c5ffd5ca90c8e05bb", "ja": "ゆ、百合子。もうその辺で……。\n流石にみんな、頭が追いつかなくなってきたから。", "zh": "百、百合子，点到为止就好……\n我看大家已经开始跟不上了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1025_026yur", "source_sha256": "1447db07634b5b482a6779473de67ec32c446f67efc8b421bbbc824d23e0edaa", "ja": "あっ、すみません！\nつい、力が入っちゃって……。", "zh": "啊，不好意思！\n一不小心就失了分寸……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1026_p", "source_sha256": "edbfe340197fbf513745f42c4568c1dcbcb233984822fd13bd573af9b628e958", "ja": "ともかく、熱意は伝わった。ここにあるマリオネットの\n設定が、話とどう関係あるのかは気になるけど……。", "zh": "总之，你的热忱大家明白了。\n虽说我很好奇这边牵线木偶的设定跟故事有什么关联……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1027_026yur", "source_sha256": "0b1876d626a4e12025aa1288e7c38dd7f6325f83bab77dc75273153abf71d760", "ja": "えっ！？　それは……と、とにかく大事なんです！\n5人を繋ぎ、そして絡め取る運命のモチーフとして！", "zh": "咦！？这部分……非、非常重要就是了！\n要表达的是牵系并纠缠、控制她们五人的命运动机！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1028_044miz", "source_sha256": "3fe51673b77259b58ca92ddcf67ab90a5d1d65a5d253c0b48bf65257797088a4", "ja": "なんと。この文章を最後まで読んだら、\nそれもわかるのでしょうか。……わくわく。", "zh": "什么……只要把文章看到最后，\n就能知道这个设定的意涵吗？……（兴奋不已）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1029_024ann", "source_sha256": "217185d75aef14547300ab0f04bea903925f30f6d23113809ee58df240087a71", "ja": "お話も、いいけど……杏奈は、\n設定資料を読んだほうが、頭に入る……かも……。", "zh": "故事是不错……但杏奈好像还是\n看过设定资料后会比较容易……理解……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0094_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0094_story_02_1030_024ann", "source_sha256": "046dcb9022c2955a6c2bd6d1eee7dc7109d93b4e9f3912e098968842f5f0319f", "ja": "スペックとか、アイテムの設定から……\n主人公たちのことが、わかる……かも……。", "zh": "从能力或道具的设定着手……\n或许比较能加深对主角们的……理解……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
